1
00:00:00,005 --> 00:00:01,675
Gentlemen?

2
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:07,510
HOWARD: Why couldn't you have
just done what Leonard did...

3
00:00:07,679 --> 00:00:10,179
(Howard:)...and get Penny a new boyfriend?

4
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:17,310
(Leonard:)My leg is killing me. Thanks for asking.

5
00:00:24,738 --> 00:00:26,408
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

6
00:00:27,198 --> 00:00:30,368
(Leonard:)Okay, I have just one question for you.

7
00:00:30,535 --> 00:00:32,995
(Leonard:)While I am perfectly happy
with the way things are...

8
00:00:33,163 --> 00:00:36,873
...you said that you didn't wanna go out
with me because I was too smart for you.

9
00:00:37,042 --> 00:00:41,212
Well, news flash, lady:
David Underhill is 10 times smarter than me.

10
00:00:41,379 --> 00:00:45,839
(Leonard:)You'd have to drive a railroad spike into
his brain for me to beat him at checkers.

11
00:00:46,551 --> 00:00:51,511
Next to him, I'm one of those sign-language
gorillas who knows how to ask for grapes.

12
00:00:52,223 --> 00:00:54,853
(Leonard:)So my question is...

13
00:00:55,018 --> 00:00:59,018
(Leonard:)...what's up with that?

